instructions:
Install using uv: `uvx flet-mcp-server`. To use with Claude Desktop, add the following to your config:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "flet-mcp-server": {
      "command": "uvx",
      "args": ["flet-mcp-server"]
    }
  }
}
```

To verify against your project's exact flet version, either pin it (`uvx --with flet==0.85.0 flet-mcp-server`) or point the server at your project venv with the FLET_MCP_VENV environment variable.
